        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "作为一个双非的同学，线下面京东还是挺紧张的。就提前找了几个京东的同学问三面的面试官和面试内容，提前看了一些问题，自己想了想怎么回答。昨天晚上没睡着觉，[石化R][石化R]3点多才睡着，脑海里全是可能的问题和面试场景。[哭惹R][哭惹R][哭惹R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "7476f260c84d084a7d1ec02ead3eaa74b92cd4cbea8b0b76cd960cdafb5a3e8e",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "今天下午四点到了京东，京东的楼占地真是大啊，然后到京东门口给hr打电话，他就下来接我，不知道为啥没收到访客链接。[叹气R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "7476f260c84d084a7d1ec02ead3eaa74b92cd4cbea8b0b76cd960cdafb5a3e8e",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "面试开始，主要是一个主管和一个hr来面我，首先主管问了一连串的项目问题，没怎么说具体技术，主要是项目经历。然后就是hr的问题，主要是常规问题，还问了我觉得自己优势在哪？定位转换。[害羞R][害羞R][害羞R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "7476f260c84d084a7d1ec02ead3eaa74b92cd4cbea8b0b76cd960cdafb5a3e8e",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "期间还聊了加班的问题，说比我之前以为的加班还严重…… 京东的同学现身说法下！[暗中观察R][暗中观察R][暗中观察R][暗中观察R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "7476f260c84d084a7d1ec02ead3eaa74b92cd4cbea8b0b76cd960cdafb5a3e8e",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "很快，30分钟结束，跟我说这是终面，明天给我结果，走出京东大楼还觉得怅然若失～[皱眉R][皱眉R][皱眉R][皱眉R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "7476f260c84d084a7d1ec02ead3eaa74b92cd4cbea8b0b76cd960cdafb5a3e8e",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "76adf5145cf3d06a3eb34fabff5e5ccdc2f66e7a7d350deea8f1daec82f66fbf",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67ceac6d000000002a00f0f0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "面试完了，回家！",
